## `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
.terraform.lock.hcl

# Secrets — never commit plaintext secrets
**/secrets.yaml
!**/secrets.sops.yaml
*.tfvars.local
```

